{"unit_id":"FurinaEsE__dsh-ui-zoom-regions#feature-persist","repo":"FurinaEsE/dsh-ui-zoom-regions","commit":"9a03900a2f4b960d2f3882387c47e3a9de7b6080","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-zoom-regions 的功能「保存缩放设置」：区域比例及顶栏高度写入浏览器 localStorage，重新载入后继续使用已保存值；读数模式则每次载入回到自动。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:169-223"]}
